{"unit_id":"yvhcel888__dsh-slide-gauge#card-zh","repo":"yvhcel888/dsh-slide-gauge","commit":"ab1e08ca02fe5c24d49358831919ff225b3592cc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 滑动测梁仪是面向 DSH 网页界面的互动挂件：它通过 webServer 路由提供浏览器脚本和图片，并把界面注入到页面中。打开右下角按钮后，可以拖动角色与标尺同步移动，查看角色位置对应的梁神、梁圣、梁子或牢梁状态；拖到两侧边界会出现鲸鱼娘彩蛋，关闭后再次打开仍可恢复上次位置。适合想在 DSH 页面中体验轻量互动挂件的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务，拖动位置保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:102-170","lib/slide-gauge.js:78-85","lib/slide-gauge.js:153-229","lib/slide-gauge.js:44-73"]}
{"unit_id":"yvhcel888__dsh-slide-gauge#card-en","repo":"yvhcel888/dsh-slide-gauge","commit":"ab1e08ca02fe5c24d49358831919ff225b3592cc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Slide Gauge is an interactive widget for DSH web. Its lower-right panel lets users drag a character and ruler, view position-based status labels, and reveal a whale at either boundary. The last position is saved in browser localStorage. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:102-170","lib/slide-gauge.js:78-85","lib/slide-gauge.js:153-229","lib/slide-gauge.js:44-73"]}
