{"unit_id":"yvhcel888__dsh-slide-gauge#feature-1","repo":"yvhcel888/dsh-slide-gauge","commit":"ab1e08ca02fe5c24d49358831919ff225b3592cc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 滑动测梁仪的悬浮面板：页面右下角按钮可打开或关闭画布面板，画布按场景坐标绘制测梁仪、标尺和角色。用户点击按钮即可打开，点关闭按钮可收起面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/slide-gauge.js:91-105","lib/slide-gauge.js:153-165"]}
